  "paths": {
    "/sync": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "cainiaoCnapOrderCancel",
        "tags": [
          "菜鸟国际出口"
        ],
        "summary": "单据取消接口",
        "description": "商家ERP主动发起取消某些创建的单据，仓库未实操出入库(取决于仓库作业流程)的可调接口取消撤回，如需重新推单需修改ERP单号。\n使用说明\n1. 支持入库单据取消。\n2. 支持出库单据取消。\n3. 支持发货单据取消。\n4. 支持销退入库取消。\n5. 支持调拨单取消。如果仓库开始操作，取消失败。\n6. orderType单据类型：PTCK=普通出库单，DBCK=调拨出库 ，QTCK=其他出库，CGTH=采购退货出库单，B2BCK=2B出库。暂不支持：XNCK=虚拟出库单，PKCK=领用/盘点出库，FCCK=换货/返厂出库单，B2CCK=B2C出库。",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "See the official response envelope and business response fields.",
            "x-aliexpress-business-schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/BusinessResponse"
            }
          }
        },
        "x-aliexpress-api-name": "cainiao.cnap.order.cancel",
        "x-aliexpress-source-url": "https://open.aliexpress.com/doc/api.htm?#/api?cid=21215&path=cainiao.cnap.order.cancel&methodType=POST",
        "x-aliexpress-source-doc-id": 1923,
